From: clawd20130 <clawd20130@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 09:54:40 +0900
Subject: KWin moto11: host Miracast display as a hot-plugged output

The nested Wayland backend binds the host's wl_output globals (v3, so
KWayland's release on removal is valid). A host output made by Moto with
model Cast becomes output CAST-n whose toplevel is fullscreen on it; phone
modes and the internal flag stay on the primary output.

Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-26
X-Rungic-Status: Inappropriate [Android host specific: runs nested in the Android APK compositor]
X-Rungic-Tests: none (gap: casting needs a TV receiver; manual list)
X-Rungic-Docs: docs/58
Origin: vendor, commit:fc2cd678
---
